point\n   - `ApiError.kt` — added SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE error code\n   - `ShipmentControllerTest.kt` — added 4 tests (+ 1 import)\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n- **ApiError.kt:** Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE` enum value to ErrorCode — necessary for the 409 Conflict scenario\n- **ShipmentController.kt:** Added `confirm()` method with proper error handling and state transitions — necessary and complete\n- **ShipmentControllerTest.kt:** Added 4 test cases covering all 4 scenarios in the requirement — necessary to verify correctness\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All acceptance criteria are met and all code paths are tested.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement: Add a POST endpoint at `/shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` that transitions CREATED shipments to CONFIRMED, allows idempotent retries on already-confirmed shipments, rejects cancelled shipments with 409, and rejects unknown shipments with 404.\n\nChanged:\n- `sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiError.kt` — Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE` error code for invalid state transitions\n- `sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt` — Added `confirm()` endpoint with state transition logic and error handling\n- `sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt` — Added 4 test cases for all scenarios (create→confirm, idempotent confirm, cancelled rejection, not-found rejection)\n\nTests:\n- `confirms a created shipment and transitions to confirmed status` — Verifies CREATED→CONFIRMED transition and persistence\n- `confirming an already confirmed shipment succeeds and changes nothing` — Verifies idempotent behavior (no change on retry)\n- `confirms a cancelled shipment is rejected with 409 conflict` — Verifies 409 with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE code\n- `confirms an unknown shipment is rejected with 404 not found` — Verifies 404 with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND code\n\nVerification: Ran `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/`